# Runtime appendix: Vue 3 (SFC)

The rules are in `00-zones.mdc`, `01-block-root.mdc`, `02-no-raw-html.mdc`,
`03-static-aria.mdc` and `06-fixtures-no-literal-text.mdc`. This file only maps
their terms to Vue 3 (SFC) syntax. Files: `*.vue` inside the composition paths of the
packages whose `ui8kit.runtime` is `vue` (see `rules/zones.json`).

## Paths

| Zone | Paths |
| --- | --- |
| Kit | `packages/vue/ui/src/primitives`, `src/utils`, `src/styles`; `apps/host-vue/xgen/runtime` |
| Composition | `packages/vue/ui/src/blocks`, `src/components`; `apps/host-vue/xgen/screens` |

## Syntax

| Term | Forbidden in composition | Use instead |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Raw HTML injection | `v-html="markup"` | kit components built from nodes |
| Dynamic tag | `<component :is="tag">`, `h(tag, ...)` with a variable tag | a kit primitive with a `tag` prop |
| Raw native tag | `<div>`, `<span>`, `<svg>` and any lowercase element that is not a Vue built-in | `Box`, `Text`, `Icon`, ... |
| Reactive ARIA state | `:aria-expanded="open"`, `v-bind:aria-current="..."` | a primitive prop: `<Button :pressed="on">` |
| Two-way binding | `v-model` (also `_nonportable.json`) | one-way `:value` plus an event prop |
| Literal text | `<Text>Save</Text>`, `label="Save"`, `{{ ok ? "Yes" : "No" }}` | `{{ ui.group.key }}`, `tpl(ui.group.key, { n })`, props |
| Component root | first element of `<template>`, looking through `<template v-if>`/`v-for` wrappers | |

Allowed structure: `<template>`, `v-if`/`v-else`/`v-for`, `<slot>`, `<Teleport>`,
`<Transition>`, `<KeepAlive>`, `<Suspense>`.
